Launch the CASE_STUDY_OS.html file in any web browser of your choice.
Choose which CPU Scheduling Algorithm you'd like to run a simulation on.
Fill in the necessary information, including:

How long each process takes to execute (Burst Time)
When each process arrives (Arrival Time)
The priority level of each process, if needed
The time slice duration, if needed


You can add or delete processes as needed, but make sure you have at least 3.
Hit the Run Simulation button to compute and view the results.
